  "worked_solution": "Since $43$ is larger than $6,$ the answer will be negative.\n\nWe start by solving an easier problem:\n\n$$\n43-6\n$$\n\nNext, we carry out the subtraction:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} &  & \\,\\,\\,\\begin{aligned}\\,\\,\\,3\\end{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\begin{aligned}\\,\\,\\,13\\end{aligned} \\\\  &  & \\,\\,\\,4\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,3\\,\\,\\, \\\\ \\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,\\,\\,\\, &  &  & \\,\\,\\,6\\,\\,\\, \\\\  &  & \\,\\,\\,3\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,7\\,\\,\\,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n43-6=37.\n$$\n\nHowever, since our answer must be negative, we need to change the sign of the answer above. \n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n6-43=-37.\n$$",
